Group SQL statements by using the method 
`addBatch`
 to add them to a batch and then execute them using 
`executeBatch`
 to send
them to the database in a single call.

Noncompliant code example

```

public void execute(Connection connection) {
  try {
    Statement statement = connection.createStatement();

    for (int i = 0; i < 10; i++) {
